cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "strRegression" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'strRegression: Structure of Regression Functions'
version: 0.0.1
abstract: 'Internal functions for the structure of a linear regression model with
  random regressors: the model-implied covariance matrix from the regression parameters,
  partial and standardized slopes, R-squared and adjusted R-squared, semipartial and
  partial correlations, Cohen''s f-squared, selective standardization, parameter index
  helpers, and the Jacobian matrices of these quantities. The functions have no input
  checks and are copied by other projects.'
